      text Bootstrap’s CSS includes multiple references to SVG files via inline data: URIs. If you define a Content Security Policy for your project that blocks data: URIs for images, then these SVG files will not load. You can get around this problem by extracting the inline SVG files using Webpack’s asset modules feature. @210,6788,501,102
